## How to read this

- **FALSO NEGATIVO** — the resource is present; the gate was wrong and the fix
  belongs in the gate.
- **FALLO REAL** — the API answered normally and the resource is genuinely
  absent; the fix belongs in the creating role, and the gate was right to block
  the deployment.
- **FALLO DE ACCESO** — the probe was rejected (401/403) or the service did not
  answer; nothing can be concluded about the resource until the key or the
  endpoint is fixed, and the gate must keep blocking.
